{
 "_comment": "Hand-entered supplement to the official NSE IPO feed. The calendar, price band and subscription come from the exchange automatically; these two blocks cannot, and are never guessed.",
 "_financials": [
  "From the company's DRHP/RHP, which is a PDF and not machine-readable.",
  "Find it on the lead manager's site, SEBI, or the NSE/BSE issue page.",
  "revenue_cr / profit_cr: latest full year, in Rs crore.",
  "pe_post_issue: the RHP states this at the upper band.",
  "peer_pe: the RHP's own peer-comparison table gives it.",
  "Record source and as_of so a stale entry is obvious."
 ],
 "_gmp": [
  "OPTIONAL and UNOFFICIAL. Grey market premium has no exchange publisher,",
  "SEBI has cautioned against relying on it, and quotes are easily moved by",
  "the operators who benefit. The engine caps its weight and can never issue",
  "APPLY on GMP alone - official demand or financials must agree.",
  "Leave it null unless you have a reason to track it."
 ],
